// Symbols plugin — type a name, get the glyph.
//
// No prefix, but it only produces rows once something is typed, and config.ron
// sets show_results_immediately: false, so the runner does not open onto a wall
// of glyphs.
//
// This exists because the machine already depends on Nerd Font glyphs for
// waybar and kitty; pasting one used to mean looking it up elsewhere.

Config(
    prefix: "",
)
